          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uMose esehla entabeni yaseSinayi ephethe amatshe amabili obufakazi, wayengazi ukuthi isikhumba sobuso bakhe siyakhazimula ngenxa yokuthi wayekade ekhuluma loNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.3.7+2CO.3.8+2CO.3.9+2CO.3.10+2CO.3.11+2CO.3.12+2CO.3.13+2CO.3.14+2CO.3.15+2CO.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 3:7–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAroni labantu bakoIsrayeli bebona ukuthi isikhumba sobuso bakhe sasikhazimula, besaba ukusondela kuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uMose wababiza; uAroni lazo zonke induna zabantu beza kuye; uMose wasekhuluma labo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwalokho basondela bonke abakoIsrayeli; wabanika ngemilayo konke iNkosi eyayikutshilo kuye entabeni yaseSinayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose eseqedile ukukhuluma labo, wambomboza ubuso bakhe ngeveli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lapho uMose engena phambi kweNkosi ukuba akhulume layo, wayelisusa iveli aze aphume; ekuphumeni kwakhe wayebatshela abakoIsrayeli lokho akulayiweyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "labakoIsrayeli babebona ukuthi isikhumba sobuso bakhe siyakhazimula; abesephinda embomboza ubuso bakhe ngeveli aze angene futhi ukuyakhuluma layo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.35"
            ]
          }
